{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104458","id":2410351508,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PqwuU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104458","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104458.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104458.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104458","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104458/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104458/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104458/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a7d18f51a2806734858f238a0d101b8f8ac1db1b","number":104458,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Web] Use actual `PThread` pool size for `get_default_thread_pool_size()`","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"fixes #104428\r\n\r\nThis resolves a freeze in WebAssembly builds when `physics/3d/run_on_separate_thread=true` and threading is enabled.\r\n\r\nPreviously, `get_default_thread_pool_size()` in `OS_Web` was hardcoded to return 1, which caused physics step group tasks to stall. The only available worker was occupied by this long-lived task:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/servers/physics_server_3d_wrap_mt.cpp#L42-L47\r\n\r\nAs a result, the following task \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_step_3d.cpp#L347\r\n\r\nwould never execute, leading to a deadlock. This patch replaces the hardcoded value with a dynamic call to a JS hook that reflects the available pthread pool size at runtime.\r\n\r\n_bugsquad edit: fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104004_\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1161726405,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTYxNzI2NDA1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/high%20priority","name":"high priority","description":"","color":"7956a5","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ff